This another great song from The White Buffalo. It's pretty easy to play, but it may
help to play along with the track once.From the YouTube videos I watched, it looks like
Jake plays the C barred on the 8th fret and just slides this formation up and down the
fret board. I think its easier to play and sounds just fine barred on 3.

